      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.35,
      "end_seconds": 153.07,
      "duration_seconds": 17.72,
      "text": "Oh, you know, I've had acid reflux, yes. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am. Work has been very busy so I kept ignoring it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.0,
      "end_seconds": 160.51,
      "duration_seconds": 6.51,
      "text": "alright, yes, diabetes and acid reflux are known to us, good to have that clear"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.79,
      "end_seconds": 175.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "is there anything relevant on the the family side?"
